{"ID":"20240314091959-1p9pcq0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091959-1p9pcq0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091959-1p9pcq0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163619-66xjmh7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163636-7sa3d4d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:923,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163636-7sa3d4d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:170,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:170\u0026#125;","title":"【蒲灰散】\u0026amp;【滑石白鱼散】\u0026amp;【茯苓戎盐汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422163636"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422163619-66xjmh7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-66xjmh7","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便不利，蒲灰散主之，滑石白鱼散茯苓戎盐汤并主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-67sb3mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-67sb3mk","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蒲灰散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-e690ubp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-e690ubp","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蒲灰半分，滑石三分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-9474y3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-9474y3h","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，杵为散，饮服方寸匕，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-81r4695","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-81r4695","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里呢，突然跑出来几个方子哦，就莫名其妙的跑出来，所以金匮条辨哦都没有整理得很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-4xg9vay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-4xg9vay","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"看小便不利，蒲灰散主之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这蒲灰散呢，是外用药，内服也可以，是用水菖蒲哦把它晒干以后烧成灰，备用。那病人呢，遇到一种情形没有办法吞食药物的时候，或者人很虚弱的时候，全身性的水肿的时候，用蒲灰散涂上去哦，那蒲灰散涂上去的时候，和一点比如身上擦一点麻油，擦一点什么，然后蒲灰散放上去哦，那这是利水的药，通利小便的，外用的，内服也可以，内服也可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-z81lro9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-z81lro9","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石白鱼散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-mzh0r50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-mzh0r50","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石、乱发烧、白鱼各二分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-lcflcv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-lcflcv2","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，杵为散，饮服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-gcbgy3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-gcbgy3a","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这滑石白鱼散、茯苓戎盐汤，这滑石过去大家都在吵，为了这个白鱼在吵，有的人认为是白色的鲤鱼，有的人认为说是书里面的蛀虫，争议很多，这个处方用的时候，诸位看啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乱发"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们有发为血余，所以如果是头发你烧过以后，是活血化瘀攻瘀血的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以说会用滑石还有乱发，就是认为膀胱里面有瘀血跟这个石头同时堵在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个才会有使用这个处方，只有这两个药混在一起，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白鱼呢，一定是利水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，好像鲤鱼啊之类的...我们中医利用到鱼这种东西呢，都是要利水，要通利这个小便用的。这个方子我很少用，很少用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-mu5mzrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-mu5mzrw","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓戎盐汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-59p0m16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-59p0m16","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓半斤，白术三两，戎盐弹丸一枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-96h7fj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-96h7fj9","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，先将茯苓白术煎成，入戎盐再煎，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-z7ut5cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-z7ut5cq","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240401142002-viy1hvd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-ebzjkxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-ebzjkxn","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（下面是茯苓戎盐汤）这里就有意思，这个茯苓戎盐汤呢，过去呢，青盐..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个戎呢，西戎嘛，讲的就是青康"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个中国历代啊有些医案的统计，这个医案很好玩，这个中国大陆，比如像枫叶一样，青康省在这个地方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），就是青海，这个大陆东南沿海一带的居民呢他们吃海盐，临近海水嘛，吃海盐，内陆这边呢，上千公里，怎么样子把海盐运到青康省呢？不可能，他们就吃的是内陆的盐，叫做青盐，那这两个盐呢，完全不一样，你吃的味道是咸的，但是功能完全不一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-5lxfa8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-5lxfa8l","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经年累月的统计，医学就是这样子啊，是一个统计学，统计的时候发现到东南沿海一带的人呢，这边多数的人呢都得到肾结石，在青海这一带的人呢没有肾结石，然后这边东南沿海的人呢无胆结石，青海的人胆结石很多，结果后来归纳起来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原来东南沿海的人喜欢吃醋，所以江浙菜里面酸味都很多，因为醋呢能够把胆洗得很干净，所以你要常常吃醋的话，根本不会有胆结石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那青海的地方呢，因为吃的是内陆内陆湖的盐，它可以把石头打掉，那他所以不会有肾结石，但是他没有吃醋，因为西方人比较喜欢吃辣，吃辣的东西，所以他很多人得到胆结石。这就是我们在胆结石的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗胆结石的病人的时候，你告诉他你多吃点醋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗肾结石的时候，告诉他我们可以用点青盐下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-v5a65s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-v5a65s6","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那煮的时候呢，诸位看，茯苓，白术...白术跟茯苓呢，去湿，能够小便排掉，这个青盐加一点进去，这个青盐呢放进去只要微煮一下让它化掉就可以了，那个汤很难喝，很咸嘛。一般来说我都是放在胶囊里面给他吃哦，那有的时候很严重我就叫他带点青盐，一个小的药匙那样子，撒进去吃，也不一定要吃一汤匙，不然吞都吞不下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163619-yxetyhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163619-yxetyhe","updated":"20240422163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们要取吐的时候，你说老师那个瓜蒂散不好，那病人病在膈上，我们要取吐法，这个膈上吐的时候，不管是铜板卡到，小朋友铜板卡到或者是痰涎拥塞，很多痰涎造成癫痫或怎么样，我们要取吐法的时候，那用瓜蒂太累，我们就把盐巴加重一点，这个盐巴加重了，无所谓青盐还是一般的海盐，你把它弄成很浓的盐汤，你自己喝看看，喝完吐掉，当场就吐掉，你试看看就知道我讲得对不对，那受不了的哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163635-4v09s9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163635-4v09s9w"}},{"ID":"20240422163636-pfg4scb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422163636-pfg4scb","updated":"20240422163636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厥而皮水者，蒲灰散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163636-7sa3d4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163636-7sa3d4d","updated":"20240422163636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"厥而皮水者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，蒲灰散呢，这个前面消渴有讲过，蒲灰嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水菖蒲的灰，平常晒干了烧了以后备用。表水很重的时候我们才会去用它"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般来说，用不到蒲灰散，因为你用防己黄芪汤、防己茯苓汤、这个麻黄附子汤、杏子汤，很多处方可以把水排掉，这个地方"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用到蒲灰散基本上是这个病人汤药没有办法下肚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，遇到汤药没有办法下肚怎么办？用蒲灰散把他身上包住，让水排出来。"}]}]}